OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,APope begins lengthy trip to Latin
OL,4,AAmerica weeks after lung cancer surgery
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was Leo himself who revealed last
OL,7,Fmonth that doctors had discovered a
OL,8,Ftumour during a routine scan. The
OL,9,Fgrowth was removed along with the lower
OL,10,Flobe of his right lung and his medical
OL,11,Fteam then confirmed the cancer had not
OL,12,Fspread.
OL,14,FAt a briefing in Rome ahead of the
OL,15,Ftrip, which takes in Uruguay and
OL,16,FArgentina as well as Peru, a
OL,17,Fspokeswoman stressed that Pope Leo had
OL,18,F"fantastic stamina" and was "extremely
OL,19,Fenthusiastic" about the schedule which
OL,20,Fhe had "personally confirmed... with no
OL,21,Fchanges".
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
